WEBVTT

00:08:57.616 --> 00:09:00.578
We in Papua New Guinea,
for example, continue to honor

00:09:00.578 --> 00:09:06.292
and acknowledge our ancestors
in our present day, in different forms,

00:09:06.333 --> 00:09:10.254
and we want to remain
as the best guardians

00:09:10.254 --> 00:09:13.674
for our world, for other people,

00:09:13.716 --> 00:09:14.925
and our children

00:09:14.967 --> 00:09:17.678
who are yet to arrive from future.

00:09:18.887 --> 00:09:21.015
We make these decisions

00:09:21.056 --> 00:09:27.354
because we want to protect
our resources in another form,

00:09:27.354 --> 00:09:29.732
in their natural state,

00:09:29.732 --> 00:09:33.777
so that it can sustain and help us.